{
  "dom_id": "step-3668",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Drawing the Graph of a Periodic Function",
  "problem": "Part of the graph of a function $y=f(x)$ with period $2$ is shown below. What is the graph of $y=f(x)$ on the interval $-4\\leq x \\leq 4?$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14230523/assets/59abf18dc978f48da4bec95bc702141b2459a327f194fda46d64f12c5bc8ffb4.png)",
  "worked_solution": "The graph above shows the function in the interval $0 \\leq x \\leq 2.$\n\nSince this interval has length $2,$ and the period of the function is also $2,$ this interval represents a single period of the function.\n\nTherefore, the function will consist of many copies of the shape shown above, shifted horizontally by multiples of $2.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14230523/assets/41a583651bf690810335776b9e7b5620e6b6830e1b59ee9d646c4ab429e17de8.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-3668\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"3668\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"1125\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-3668\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Drawing the Graph of a Periodic Function</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"3668\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n